            <h2>Service Overview</h2>
            <p>I advise leadership teams on platform evolution, scaling, technical risk, and innovation. When your board or executive team needs a trusted technical voice to help guide major decisions, I provide the perspective that only comes from decades of building, breaking, and fixing real systems.</p>

            <h2>How I Contribute</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Technical advisory for executive teams and boards of directors</li>
                <li>Platform strategy and technology roadmap guidance</li>
                <li>Risk assessment for technical investments and acquisitions</li>
                <li>Innovation strategy and emerging technology evaluation</li>
                <li>Mentorship for CTOs, VPs of Engineering, and technical leaders</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Engagement Models</h2>
            <p>Advisory engagements are flexible by nature. I work with companies on a quarterly or ongoing basis, attending board meetings, participating in strategy sessions, and being available for ad hoc guidance between sessions.</p>

